{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id468895992"}, "name":{"label":"VinhKieuQ"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-04-12T06:29:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"57.2"}, "id":{"label":"11149587072"}, "title":{"label":"CSO Gallery"}, "content":{"label":"CSO Gallery Hoi An is truly a remarkable destination for art and history enthusiasts alike. With such diverse and unique collections, visitors are in for an enriching journey through the cultural and historical epochs of Vietnam and the world.\n\nThe collection of \"Truyen Kieu\" by the great poet Nguyen Du is a cultural treasure of immense value. Recognized by UNESCO since 1966, it is not only a magnificent literary work of Vietnam but also an integral part of the world heritage.\n\nThe collection of record-breaking Horse Mascot stamps from Vietnam in 2023 is sure to captivate enthusiasts of stamp art.\n\nFrom ancient coins dating back to the reign of Emperor Dinh Tien Hoang to the period of national independence, the collection of ancient Vietnamese currency offers insights into the economic and cultural development of Vietnam through different historical periods.\n\nMoreover, having thousands of overprinted stamps with hundreds of years of history from various countries around the world will provide visitors with a comprehensive view of stamp art and the global landscape.\n\nWith collections ranging from Women's Currency, Special Denomination Currency, Unique Currency Designs, Military Currency, FAO Currency, and many others, visitors will marvel at the diversity and richness of currencies worldwide.\n\nAll of these elements create a comfortable space for visitors to focus, explore, and appreciate the invaluable historical and cultural knowledge. It's truly difficult to find another place that can offer such an extraordinary experience as CSO Gallery Hoi An.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=284876795&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
