{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id188587673"}, "name":{"label":"Birdvietnam"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-03-26T04:03:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"51.7"}, "id":{"label":"9753602579"}, "title":{"label":"Hotel for nature lovers"}, "content":{"label":"If you're a nature lover looking for an unforgettable vacation experience, look no further than Wildbird Hotel. Situated in Tram Chim National Park, one of the world's precious Ramsar sites, this hotel offers a chance to explore the unique biodiversity of the Dong Thap Muoi region's natural wetland areas.\n\nBut that's not all. At Wildbird Hotel, you can enjoy modern and luxurious amenities while also knowing that you're helping to protect the environment. The hotel is committed to reducing waste, particularly plastic, and creating job opportunities for the local community to help develop a sustainable economy.\n\nThe hotel also boasts a conference room that can accommodate up to 50 people, making it perfect for scientific, environmental, and biodiversity training courses.\n\nOverall, Wildbird Hotel is an ideal destination for anyone looking for a peaceful, colorful, and eco-friendly vacation. I highly recommend this hotel for anyone visiting the area.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=284876795&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
